     "t": "h2",
     "text": "The Blueprint for Your AWS Ecosystem"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Our practice is built on four integrated pillars, designed to architect a cohesive, future-ready enterprise on the AWS platform"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Migration & Modernization"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Data Analytics & AI"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Security & Governance"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Max-IT™"
    },
    {
     "t": "h2",
     "text": "Migration & Modernization"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "We architect your seamless transition to the AWS cloud. Leveraging proven frameworks like the AWS Migration Acceleration Program (MAP), we de-risk your journey and ensure your new foundation is secure, optimized, and built for agility."
    },
    {
     "t": "link",
     "text": "Explore Migration & Modernization",
     "href": "./aws/migration-modernization"
    },
    {
