     "t": "p",
     "text": "For a global life sciences leader, we architected a pioneering Intelligent Document Management System. This enterprise-grade solution, built on Amazon Bedrock, transformed their ability to analyze over 10,000 complex, unstructured documents with unprecedented speed and accuracy."
    },
