  {
   "name": "Features",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "h2",
     "text": "The Quadra Advantage for AWS"
    },
    {
     "t": "h5",
     "text": "Business-First Mindset, Not Just Technology-First"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "We share AWS's obsession with the customer. We start with your business challenges and work backwards, architecting AWS solutions that are laser-focused on delivering your specific strategic outcomes."
    },
    {
     "t": "h5",
     "text": "A Holistic, Multi-Cloud Perspective"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Our deep expertise across other platforms means we provide unbiased, pragmatic advice. We architect the right AWS solution for you, ensuring it integrates seamlessly into your broader enterprise ecosystem without creating vendor lock-in."
    },
    {
     "t": "h5",
     "text": "Proven Methodologies & A Stable Team"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "We combine AWS best practices (7R, Well-Architected) with the power of a deeply experienced team. Our unique culture of employee longevity ensures your critical AWS projects are guided by consistent, expert hands from start to finish."
    }
   ]
